    "sections": {
        "description": "Weather Forecast Theme provides a structured layout for weather updates, forecast reports, seasonal information, and climate-related content. The design includes responsive sections, customizable homepage elements, and organized content blocks that adapt across desktop and mobile devices. Built-in customization settings allow adjustments to colors, typography, banners, and navigation layouts without requiring advanced coding. The theme includes widget-ready areas, blog support, image sections, and footer customization options for flexible content arrangement. It supports standard plugins for forms, SEO management, caching, and galleries to extend functionality when needed. The layout is designed with clean coding standards to maintain stable performance and easier content navigation. Social media integration and newsletter sections are also included for communication purposes. Multiple page templates and customizable headers help maintain a consistent visual structure across different pages. The overall design focuses on readability, responsive performance, and straightforward content presentation for weather-related websites."
    },
